{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Gratodo 是一款整合習慣追蹤、GTD 任務管理及 Pomodoro 專注計時器的多功能效率工具，適合希望將日常目標與工作待辦集中管理的用戶。目前 App Store 提供限時免費下載，原價為 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>氣泡互動與全方位效率管理</h2>\n<p>這款應用將習慣檢查化為螢幕上的浮動氣泡，點擊即可打卡並累積連續記錄。內建四種習慣模式與自動休息日設定，搭配 GTD 收件箱整理流程及可自定義的番茄鐘專註區間。數據全數本地存儲，無需註冊帳戶即享無干擾體驗，更支援主畫面小組件快速檢視今日進度與靈感語錄，讓習慣養成與時間管理在單一介面中流暢運作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-192-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-193-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-194-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-195-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Gratodo: Habit Tracker &amp; To Do</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:59:47.753494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}